Call for Papers
https://popl27.sigplan.org/home/fpbt-2027

We are excited to announce that the first annual Future of Property-Based
Testing Workshop (FPBT'27) will be happening in Mexico City on January 12th
(co-located with POPL'27)!

FPBT will bring together researchers and educators who work on and teach
PBT to talk about what technical advances the research community should
focus on in the coming years, and how we can best bring PBT to the next
generation of software developers.

Submissions are open now (deadline October 23rd); see
https://popl27.sigplan.org/home/fpbt-2027 for details.

